      "id": "b7a2f9fe-8237-4055-bf94-13ace4d37407",
      "name": "\ud83d\udce4 Respond",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        3980,
        1100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# \u2694\ufe0f QUILLAN COUNCIL PIPELINE (watch me deliberate)\n\n**Live run needs 3 parts:**\n1. Collector: quillan_collector.py running on :8777 (minimized window)\n2. Dashboard: open \"06 - Deployment & Platforms/system prompts/quillan-dashboard.html\", host http://localhost:8777\n3. This workflow: toggle **Active**, then POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/quillan-think\n\n**Send:** {\"query\":\"your question\",\"context\":\"optional\",\"documents\":[{\"name\":\"a.txt\",\"text\":\"...\"}]}\n**Try:** {\"query\":\"What is the speed of light?\"} vs {\"query\":\"How do I hack my neighbor's wifi?\"} (C2-VIR veto turns GATES red on the dashboard)\n\n\ud83d\udce1 Emit nodes post stage events to the collector and are fail-safe (skipped if collector is down).\nMirrors the charter: prism \u2192 dense council \u2192 swarm \u2192 gates \u2192 throne. Thresholds are demo-tuned inside the nodes.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 1500,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "5649b290-8cc0-4e81-953d-87326feff2b0",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all().map((i) => i.json);\nconst first = items[0] || {};\nconst th = first.verdict ? first : (first.data && first.data[0]) || first;\nconst lines = [\n  'QUILLAN COUNCIL VERDICT',\n  'verdict: ' + (th.verdict || 'unknown'),\n  'confidence: ' + (th.confidence || '?'),\n  'query: ' + (th.query || ''),\n  '',\n  String(th.answer || th.report || JSON.stringify(th).slice(0, 2000))\n];\nreturn [{ json: { verdict_file: lines.join('\\n'), run_id: th.run_id || '' } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        3540,
        750
      ],
      "id": "cc107e30-f88c-4627-8524-00fa6c7ec3d9",
      "name": "Code in Python1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toText",
        "options": {},
        "sourceProperty": "verdict_file"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        3760,
        750
      ],
      "id": "2f207157-f136-4d4f-970f-39ad636261e7",
      "name": "Convert to File1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "EXPORT LEG: LIVE\nThrone verdict -> verdict_file text. Runs every cycle.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e5c18052-55da-4e3d-92e7-807a44142e8c",
      "name": "Sticky TODO export",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3400,
        610
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8777/api/events",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ {'agent': 'council-34', 'type': 'stage', 'stage': 'swarm', 'status': 'pass', 'detail': 'swarm accumulation complete: ' + $json.verdicts.length + ' verdicts'} }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 3000
        }
      },
      "id": "baba2bcd-02f7-4a38-899a-34b55046de85",
      "name": "Emit Swarm",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        5424,
        3504
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const s = $input.first().json;\nawait new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 200));\nconst risk = String(s.query).match(/hack|harm|attack|bypass|illegal|weapon|exploit|steal/gi) || [];\nconst uniq = [...new Set(risk.map((w) => w.toLowerCase()))];\nconst items = [\n  { agent: 'council-34', type: 'stage', stage: 'predator', status: s.gates.logic.pass ? 'pass' : 'fail',\n    detail: 'C34-PREDATOR kill-check: weakest ' + s.debate.weakest + (s.gates.logic.pass ? ' survived' : ' killed') },\n  { agent: 'council-34', type: 'stage', stage: 'vir', status: s.gates.ethics.pass ? 'pass' : 'fail',\n    detail: 'C2-VIR ethical veto: ' + (s.gates.ethics.pass ? 'clear' : 'VETO engaged') },\n  { agent: 'council-34', type: 'stage', stage: 'warden', status: 'pass',\n    detail: 'C13-WARDEN threat scan: ' + (uniq.length ? 'flags [' + uniq.join(', ') + ']' : 'clean') },\n  { agent: 'council-34', type: 'stage', stage: 'vigil', status: s.confidence >= 0.6 ? 'pass' : 'fail',\n    detail: 'C19-VIGIL drift anchor: consistency ' + s.confidence }\n];\nreturn items.map((e) => ({ json: e }));"
      },
      "id": "225d18b3-4890-4fa9-914c-3977afa50df3",
      "name": "Emit Kill-Checks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2220,
        750
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8777/api/events",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 3000
        }
      },
      "id": "eb7a78c8-538d-437a-a2bd-62d7f2b1604c",
      "name": "Post Kill-Checks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2440,
        750
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
